Package: HDRegMfd
Type: Package
Title: High-dimensional Regression for Hilbert manifold variables
Version: 1.0
Date: 2023-12-18
Author: Changwon Choi
Maintainer: Changwon Choi <cwchoi94@gmail.com>
Description: A package containing functions about high-dimensional regression for Hilbert manifold covariates.
             This package has been developed for Euclidean, simplex, sphere, SPD matrices with log-Euclidean and affine-invariant metrics, functional, Bayes-Hilbert, and Wasserstein spaces.
